OL,3,GNEWSA'Strong leadership' praised as
OL,4,Acare home improves
OL,5,
OL,6,FA care home, where some residents
OL,7,Freceived only one shower in a month and
OL,8,Fone told inspectors they were left in
OL,9,Fbed "starving", has improved after
OL,10,Fbeing put into special measures.
OL,12,FChristopher Grange Residential Care, in
OL,13,FEast Prescot, Liverpool, was rated
OL,14,FInadequate in March over its delays in
OL,15,Fgiving personal care and not always
OL,16,Ftreating people with dignity.
OL,18,FBut after a further Care Quality
OL,19,FCommission (CQC) visit in July it has
OL,20,Fnow been upgraded to Good, with the
OL,21,Fwatchdog praising "strong leadership"
OL,22,Ffor the turnaround.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
